The photographs in this directory are bundled as wallpapers for the
display. They are not covered by the repository's PolyForm Noncommercial
license: each stays solely under its own license, listed below. All were
taken from the elementary OS wallpaper collection
<https://github.com/elementary/wallpapers>, whose debian/copyright file
records the provenance; the copies here are resized and recompressed for
this device (1600x960 JPEG).

